// Jon Irenicus - Ascension
I_C_T IRENIC2 12 LK#IylosJonIrenicusComment
  == LK#IYLJ IF ~InParty("Iylos") InMyArea("Iylos") !StateCheck("Iylos",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)~ THEN ~Perhaps, Irenicus, but consider this: <CHARNAME> defeated you once--and <PRO_HESHE> shall do so again!~
  == IRENIC2 ~你那点微不足道的反抗无足轻重，修士。回去继续你那些可悲的絮叨吧，真正的谈话留给成年人。~
  == IRENIC2 ~你*会*屈服的，<CHARNAME>，会倒下，就像我当年一样。~
END

// Balthazar - Ascension
I_C_T BALTH2 5 LK#IylosBalth2Comment
  == LK#IYLJ IF ~InParty("Iylos") InMyArea("Iylos") !StateCheck("Iylos",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)~ THEN ~You cannot truly believe she will attain her goal, do you, brother?~
  == BALTH2  ~我不再保留那个称呼了，伊洛斯。我一派你去监视<CHARNAME>，就弃了这个称呼。~
  == LK#IYLJ ~我——~
  == BALTH2  ~不，伊洛斯。此时此地都不是谈这个的时候。这也许不是世界的终结，但它是*我们*世界的终结，我们必须为保住它而战！~
  == BALTH2  ~快，<CHARNAME>——我们得尽快切断她的力量之源，否则我怕她会得到她渴求的力量。~
END


// Balthazar - Ascension
I_C_T BALTH2 9 LK#IylosBalth2Comment2
  == LK#IYLJ IF ~InParty("Iylos") InMyArea("Iylos") !StateCheck("Iylos",CD_STATE_NOTVALID)~ THEN ~You need no longer imagine, brother; for a creature of such beauty would not lie.  You are are mortal, brother.  What will you do now?~
  == BALTH2  ~我不知道。我……我也许会回阿姆凯斯兰。此外，再看吧。还有我——在我说了那些话之后，你不该再叫我兄弟。~
  == LK#IYLJ ~这无关紧要，兄弟。~
  == BALTH2  ~那就别说了，伊洛斯。这里还有话没说完。~
END